                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip3:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 附魔金毒马铃薯" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="附魔金毒马铃薯的合成配方类似于Java版1.9和基岩版1.2.13前附魔金苹果的合成配方。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 毒树脂" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="“对以上的注释：这些词很好，但我找不到它们的用途[G]。点赞、评论并订阅！我们下次再见，拜拜！”（Comment on ^: These are nice, but I can&apos;t find a use for them [G]. Leave a like, leave a comment, and subscribe!, and see you in the next one, bye!）" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 诡异菌岩" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="菌岩的英文名称nylium是“Nether（下界）”和“Mycelium（菌丝体）”的混成词。" />
